@startuml agentic-product-execution-boundary
title Agentic Product Execution Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §8 + CR-ES-016 §5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Product Intent;
:Product Context;
:Interpret Intent;
:Assess Context;
:Select / Coordinate Action;
:Product Execution;
:Product Outcome;
if (Adapt?) then (yes)
  :Adapt;
elseif (Escalate?) then (yes)
  :Escalate;
endif

stop

note right
  Per ADR-ES-016 §8 + §15, the entire product does NOT need
  to operate agentically. Mixed realization permitted.
end note

@enduml
